```
Shared secret K (base32), 20 bytes, generated server-side, shown once
Counter T = floor((unixTime - T0) / X)   with X = 30 s
HOTP:  HMAC-SHA1(K, T_be64)  ->  dynamic truncation  ->  6-digit code
TOTP = HOTP(K, T)  for the current window (and optionally T-1, T+1)
